      "context": "Import & Export",
      "contextHash": "889414db77dad77f37f47576854286852cc224349fc630ce28e3267453a6aceb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b56f12d9868c8f6f3e16b48f_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To import a note:",
      "sourceHash": "b56f12d9868c8f6f3e16b48f082846192d098213b77779388d299a399e200f13",
      "context": "Import & Export",
      "contextHash": "889414db77dad77f37f47576854286852cc224349fc630ce28e3267453a6aceb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_34fc66d9b140edb9416a9526_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The easiest way to import is to simply drag & drop a file or an archive into the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "34fc66d9b140edb9416a9526f123572f3bd5d10b3630397b2beeaa749d3962a5",
      "context": "Import & Export",
      "contextHash": "889414db77dad77f37f47576854286852cc224349fc630ce28e3267453a6aceb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e85610f4e4bee3ba83ddabac_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "This will automatically detect some formats such as __TRILIUM_PH_0__Obsidian__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "e85610f4e4bee3ba83ddabac7b3ca0372e6c6893b07ef8d5a8806ea51e160dfe",
      "context": "Import & Export",
      "contextHash": "889414db77dad77f37f47576854286852cc224349fc630ce28e3267453a6aceb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0fbd3552d5c1177044770daf_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Safe import__TRILIUM_PH_1__ is automatically on to prevent accidental running of foreign scripts.",
      "sourceHash": "0fbd3552d5c1177044770dafd554174195e21f89715c1866aa0cb6a5a667a79e",
      "context": "Import & Export",
      "contextHash": "889414db77dad77f37f47576854286852cc224349fc630ce28e3267453a6aceb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c7cbd1173c3546259defa7f4_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To configure an import, there is a dedicated dialog which can be accessed from either __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Import into note__TRILIUM_PH_3__ or __TRILIUM_PH_4__Note menu__TRILIUM_PH_5__ → __TRILIUM_PH_6__Import into note__TRILIUM_PH_7__.",
      "sourceHash": "c7cbd1173c3546259defa7f4068c3dc798714ec72cd62bd441548a1aed4928d7",
      "context": "Import & Export",
      "contextHash": "889414db77dad77f37f47576854286852cc224349fc630ce28e3267453a6aceb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a6e222e0ecff630e35991307_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "This feature allows for dedicated importers for others apps such as __TRILIUM_PH_0__Obsidian__TRILIUM_PH_1__ or __TRILIUM_PH_2__Microsoft OneNote__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "a6e222e0ecff630e359913077c19d8d1587e84f036340242b4811557e612cbc5",
      "context": "Import & Export",
      "contextHash": "889414db77dad77f37f47576854286852cc224349fc630ce28e3267453a6aceb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b4bc5951eea4202ba2113d51_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Safe import__TRILIUM_PH_1__ as well as other options can be configured from the collapsed __TRILIUM_PH_2__Options__TRILIUM_PH_3__ section at the bottom.",
      "sourceHash": "b4bc5951eea4202ba2113d51a7cb3ebdfc9ce1d870bda83169563e462495033e",
      "context": "Import & Export",
      "contextHash": "889414db77dad77f37f47576854286852cc224349fc630ce28e3267453a6aceb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2d4763412ee31cf1485f214d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To export a note, right click the note in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and select __TRILIUM_PH_2__Export__TRILIUM_PH_3__. Similarly, in __TRILIUM_PH_4__Note menu__TRILIUM_PH_5__ there is a __TRILIUM_PH_6__Export note__TRILIUM_PH_7__ option.",
      "sourceHash": "2d4763412ee31cf1485f214de3f7aa211f5ad3cae3e32c632adfd7bd3755fd67",
      "context": "Import & Export",
      "contextHash": "889414db77dad77f37f47576854286852cc224349fc630ce28e3267453a6aceb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9ee7bb727750e0d4cf9b9378_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Supported formats__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "9ee7bb727750e0d4cf9b9378d59ea667bc705f767f3616102853ff696b602e7a",
      "context": "Import & Export > Supported formats",
      "contextHash": "007fe57c574139beee991e34faec898cea9cee4e6e3fb8bf1a2e705b626d61d4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e72a18b2ab89e038ee34f293_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Trilium natively supports the following formats for both import and export.",
      "sourceHash": "e72a18b2ab89e038ee34f293c6c1c4c5c9edf1bc31c43b4b39791c3e40cb18ca",
      "context": "Import & Export > Supported formats",
      "contextHash": "007fe57c574139beee991e34faec898cea9cee4e6e3fb8bf1a2e705b626d61d4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_99f55749d53f3ff58412f3b1_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "HTML:",
      "sourceHash": "99f55749d53f3ff58412f3b112702140ce15eca17a36ae78b522dbc53ce701c6",
      "context": "Import & Export > Supported formats",
      "contextHash": "007fe57c574139beee991e34faec898cea9cee4e6e3fb8bf1a2e705b626d61d4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2a4577b280eb0dce7f45c17a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "This is the main format used by Trilium, where standard tags are used to represent basic formatting and layout (e.g. __TRILIUM_PH_0__, __TRILIUM_PH_1__, __TRILIUM_PH_2__).",
      "sourceHash": "2a4577b280eb0dce7f45c17a76063faf6ae1f7becb43245dc5c9817ebe9fe2ac",
      "context": "Import & Export > Supported formats",
      "contextHash": "007fe57c574139beee991e34faec898cea9cee4e6e3fb8bf1a2e705b626d61d4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a12eceb8e97ecd1ba149644e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Note that HTML is not a standardized format so some more specific features such as admonitions or __TRILIUM_PH_0__Internal (reference) links__TRILIUM_PH_1__ might not be supported by other applications.",
      "sourceHash": "a12eceb8e97ecd1ba149644e99f8e17963bf68fb1b903b9b92e6c3f572eb1bfc",
      "context": "Import & Export > Supported formats",
      "contextHash": "007fe57c574139beee991e34faec898cea9cee4e6e3fb8bf1a2e705b626d61d4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_81a66f4b7b7b2e2f32c4d333_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The notes can also be exported as __TRILIUM_PH_0__static HTML that can be used for web publishing__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "81a66f4b7b7b2e2f32c4d33313c06b8f4dabaf03554f165befcf9dc91121dc37",
      "context": "Import & Export > Supported formats",
      "contextHash": "007fe57c574139beee991e34faec898cea9cee4e6e3fb8bf1a2e705b626d61d4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2e8fe4f16d5756ea29ece57b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Markdown__TRILIUM_PH_1__",
      "sourceHash": "2e8fe4f16d5756ea29ece57b2a71f88ca7cba671dbfd591c22c868795d6b7b76",
      "context": "Import & Export > Supported formats",
      "contextHash": "007fe57c574139beee991e34faec898cea9cee4e6e3fb8bf1a2e705b626d61d4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_23cd6e67a59d8eabcaf8464f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Most of the formatting is preserved, see __TRILIUM_PH_0__Supported syntax__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "23cd6e67a59d8eabcaf8464f9d2b1519dcf280f8da55c5ec17b0224155a861dc",
      "context": "Import & Export > Supported formats",
      "contextHash": "007fe57c574139beee991e34faec898cea9cee4e6e3fb8bf1a2e705b626d61d4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ae78fae5eecf85adea7776ea_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "OPML (Outliner Interchange Format)",
      "sourceHash": "ae78fae5eecf85adea7776eab2d0fee2ac9fbc966a781ba5cd5b2576d7d30ccc",
      "context": "Import & Export > Supported formats",
      "contextHash": "007fe57c574139beee991e34faec898cea9cee4e6e3fb8bf1a2e705b626d61d4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_885d6ebf8866c7263282de9b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Supports both OPML v1.0 for plain text and v2.0 with HTML support.",
      "sourceHash": "885d6ebf8866c7263282de9b59416b822319d87f03f323141faa4a298f4d3bdf",
      "context": "Import & Export > Supported formats",
      "contextHash": "007fe57c574139beee991e34faec898cea9cee4e6e3fb8bf1a2e705b626d61d4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5faaeb1459fa9b97abb82cd2_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To import from other applications such as OneNote, Notion and others, see __TRILIUM_PH_0__Importing data from other applications__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "5faaeb1459fa9b97abb82cd22be5841a4e4e8e804c3ab91f6aeba82fe53e488b",
      "context": "Import & Export > Supported formats",
      "contextHash": "007fe57c574139beee991e34faec898cea9cee4e6e3fb8bf1a2e705b626d61d4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_643a803de1c3297931ad82f3_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Maximum import size__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "643a803de1c3297931ad82f3683c4d60662ac79fad11d96523340627a6201c53",
      "context": "Import & Export > Maximum import size",
      "contextHash": "062b7d33178d690e0f864ac4f460eb8ad49df740d39d55e3c2056d2d1f36297c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_63ef6d4d8ca6ed8d48a8b932_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Versions prior to v0.104.0 had an upload limit of 250 MiB that could be bypassed via a __TRILIUM_PH_0__ environment variable; with v0.104.0 this limit was removed.",
      "sourceHash": "63ef6d4d8ca6ed8d48a8b932593f1a66fce5078ce4b08764e67b64cf5617531d",
      "context": "Import & Export > Maximum import size",
      "contextHash": "062b7d33178d690e0f864ac4f460eb8ad49df740d39d55e3c2056d2d1f36297c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c5bd2eae226dd8a6a4a14934_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Nevertheless, there is still a limit for the maximum size of a __TRILIUM_PH_0__single item__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (whether it's a __TRILIUM_PH_2__File__TRILIUM_PH_3__, an __TRILIUM_PH_4__Attachments__TRILIUM_PH_5__ or even a __TRILIUM_PH_6__Text__TRILIUM_PH_7__ note). The limit is approximately 374 MiB and it's determined by the __TRILIUM_PH_8__Synchronization__TRILIUM_PH_9__ protocol. Attempts to import such large files will be refused.",
      "sourceHash": "c5bd2eae226dd8a6a4a14934406a4bbaabbae8b1f6edb967b79082248448685d",
      "context": "Import & Export > Maximum import size",
      "contextHash": "062b7d33178d690e0f864ac4f460eb8ad49df740d39d55e3c2056d2d1f36297c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d9f90cc59931fee5cf97322e_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "During large imports or exports, memory consumption might spike but it will remain somewhere around the 2 gigabyte mark. Tested with a 2.4 GB database with ~21k notes.",
      "sourceHash": "d9f90cc59931fee5cf97322e45645335c75122d80e616285d5ec05f92aeb530f",
      "context": "Import & Export > Maximum import size",
      "contextHash": "062b7d33178d690e0f864ac4f460eb8ad49df740d39d55e3c2056d2d1f36297c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e32c01c00e0e681012808b60_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "For the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Desktop Installation__TRILIUM_PH_1__, there are two distinct import mechanisms:",
      "sourceHash": "e32c01c00e0e681012808b601a281cf0ee5909cc25d3a91321c9f6d7b2c61a61",
      "context": "Import & Export > Maximum import size",
      "contextHash": "062b7d33178d690e0f864ac4f460eb8ad49df740d39d55e3c2056d2d1f36297c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d5cad2b827e7fba329d0dafc_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A quick import, from the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "d5cad2b827e7fba329d0dafceab6b11c1787bdc89186f37bc8d2a8256740bc54",
      "context": "Import & Export > Maximum import size",
      "contextHash": "062b7d33178d690e0f864ac4f460eb8ad49df740d39d55e3c2056d2d1f36297c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6b3d1a4026b95557ed26f9e6_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The import dialog (via right click in the note tree → __TRILIUM_PH_0__Import into note__TRILIUM_PH_1__ or from __TRILIUM_PH_2__Note menu__TRILIUM_PH_3__).",
      "sourceHash": "6b3d1a4026b95557ed26f9e6941e687bd11ac57cd9d135f0bce876c541a796d3",
      "context": "Import & Export > Maximum import size",
      "contextHash": "062b7d33178d690e0f864ac4f460eb8ad49df740d39d55e3c2056d2d1f36297c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0e478db14bd8a242f3d1fa5e_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When dealing with large files (multi-gigabyte), prefer using the import dialog as it has a special mechanism which makes sure that the file is read directly from disk rather than uploaded again.",
      "sourceHash": "0e478db14bd8a242f3d1fa5e16ea0ec59348d61327bc50b9693199df92d4bbbc",
      "context": "Import & Export > Maximum import size",
      "contextHash": "062b7d33178d690e0f864ac4f460eb8ad49df740d39d55e3c2056d2d1f36297c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_838d8bef8fd364db39d9bb79_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Exporting the root note__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "838d8bef8fd364db39d9bb79e4cc41754880eb1fe4d5f44979dd83fa2f3b68d9",
      "context": "Import & Export > Exporting the root note",
      "contextHash": "8628af2e411e8173cc5e1d4472ca4161af4b6dcd9015530c94f4973e097d058c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cf214ba6ee00ec2a15cff179_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The root note is the top-most note. Exporting it behaves just like any other note: right click on it in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and select __TRILIUM_PH_2__Export__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "cf214ba6ee00ec2a15cff1797b7e7f10d4c6a3e848b123f1ac17b9f891cfbe8d",
      "context": "Import & Export > Exporting the root note",
      "contextHash": "8628af2e411e8173cc5e1d4472ca4161af4b6dcd9015530c94f4973e097d058c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f5d9c496bde6ba09bee90a0c_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Starting with v0.104.0, when a root note is imported, it will be imported as a child of your existing root note. This behavior makes sure that the import cannot change or overwrite your existing notes.",
      "sourceHash": "f5d9c496bde6ba09bee90a0c6420282dc7c6b5ec0803db46f266372bbcc1b767",
      "context": "Import & Export > Exporting the root note",
      "contextHash": "8628af2e411e8173cc5e1d4472ca4161af4b6dcd9015530c94f4973e097d058c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_25a77949a061463dd62d9b16_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "You can easily move the notes onto the root using the tree's __TRILIUM_PH_0__Multiple selection__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and delete the redundant root note.",
      "sourceHash": "25a77949a061463dd62d9b16c7f18dd15fa9bed00e5510718273810740c2653f",
      "context": "Import & Export > Exporting the root note",
      "contextHash": "8628af2e411e8173cc5e1d4472ca4161af4b6dcd9015530c94f4973e097d058c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
