      "source": "The in-app User Guide can be exported like any other note: right click one of its pages or chapters in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and select __TRILIUM_PH_2__Export__TRILIUM_PH_3__, or use __TRILIUM_PH_4__Note menu__TRILIUM_PH_5__ → __TRILIUM_PH_6__Export note__TRILIUM_PH_7__.",
